OL,3,GNEWSATerror-accused had suicide vest
OL,4,Aguide on phone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of belonging to the
OL,7,Fso-called Islamic State (IS) had
OL,8,Finformation on his phone about how to
OL,9,Fproduce suicide vests, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FBirmingham Crown Court heard Abdullah
OL,13,FYousef, 24, had an "apparent interest"
OL,14,Fin explosives and created a Telegram
OL,15,Fgroup in May 2024 where IS material was
OL,16,Fallegedly shared.
OL,18,FProsecutors said more than 7,000
OL,19,Fphotographs, 21,000 videos and 270
OL,20,Flinks were shared in the group, which
OL,21,Flisted Yousef as its owner.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
